  "mechanics": "Tracked background client/service launch and request preservation/control send leave Qt and the Stop state lock free of those blocking operations. Separate send ownership, actual thread-exit observation and input-handle write leases prevent second dispatch or cleanup while a writer remains. Stop wins before logical send admission; late failure cannot revive Stop or replace a validated result. Original attempt, envelope, selected lifetime and deadline remain fixed. Unpersisted exact requests remain in memory through STOPPED. Reservation return is not disk/IPC acknowledgement; logical admission is not physical WriteFile ordering; memory retention is not restart durability.",
  "application_root": "T:\\00-Active\\CETA-desktop-delivery-20260906\\rebuild_ios",
  "next_action": "Implement authenticated proposal-to-issuance recovery when the permit selector is lost, typed durable task/draft native workflows, and real service-owned time/approval/resource custody. Qualify native/model/hardware/device/custody/distributed/independent/installed/endurance behavior against the complete product requirements. Universal driver bounds and synchronous result-read occupancy remain unqualified; no original case, formal gate or work-package completion is inferred.",
